# T78 flags part (row I171): FLAG wrong / FLAG skip mark the song being played in the library DB; the
# query keys wrong:yes and skip:yes find it; SHUFFLE never picks a skip-flagged song (skip_excluded is the
# sentinel that the order builder ran the check). selecta-test-mk.mod is the flagged song.
QUEUE_ADD selecta-test-mk.mod
QUEUE_ADD selecta-test.mod
QUEUE_ADD selecta-short.mod
QUEUE_ADD selecta-loop.mod
PLAY
@render 1
FLAG skip
FLAG wrong stutters
LIBRARY_SEARCH wrong:yes
@results
LIBRARY_SEARCH skip:yes
@results
SHUFFLE on 7
PLAY
@render 1
@queue
NEXT
@render 1
@queue
NEXT
@render 1
@queue
NEXT
@render 1
@queue
NEXT
@render 1
@queue
NEXT
@render 1
@queue
NEXT
@render 1
@queue
NEXT
@render 1
@queue
@library_stats
